WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.580
Every word on a record can be changed, before it goes out and after.

2
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.980
But nothing is changed without trace.

3
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:12.480
Every edit is kept in the record's history, with who made it and when.

4
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.900
That way, you can always see exactly what was changed.
